<title>USA: ProxyMed signs six partnership agreements.</title>
<headline>ProxyMed signs six partnership agreements.</headline>
<dateline>FT. LAUDERDALE, Fla. 1996-11-05</dateline>
<text>
<p>ProxyMed Inc said on Tuesday it signed six additional electronic commerce partnership agreements with physician practice management systems developers.</p>
<p>ProxyMed is a healthcare information technology company that electronically links physicians, pharmacies and managed care orgaizations.</p>
</text>
